"pwa","typescript","web","web-framework","web-performance"],"visibility":"public","forks":27109,"open_issues":1141,"watchers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/pulls/17893","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/17893","diff_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/17893.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/17893.patch","merged_at":"2017-07-07T15:46:42Z"},"body":"Fixes: #17888\r\n\r\n## PR Type\r\nWhat kind of change does this PR introduce?\r\n\r\n<!-- Please check the one that applies to this PR using \"x\". -->\r\n```\r\n[x] Bugfix\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the current behavior?\r\n<!-- Please describe the current behavior that you are modifying, or link to a relevant issue. -->\r\n\r\nIssue Number: #17888\r\n\r\nFlat modules bundle index ignores symbols that are reexported from other modules. This breaks being able to split a flat module into two modules, *new* and *existing*, which re-exports all symbols moved to *new* in *existing* to avoid breaking changes to users of *existing*.\r\n\r\n## What is the new behavior?\r\n\r\nIf a re-export symbol is exported in the flat module index an exports entry is created to inform the static reflector of the re-export.\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n```\r\n[ ] Yes\r\n[x] No\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/17893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/17893/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1146784658,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDExNDY3ODQ2NTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1146784658","actor":{"login":"chuckjaz","id":37201